{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EVERY STEP IS A RISK. CAN YOU MAKE IT?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think before you move. Once you move, your vision gets limited, and only memory and reflexes can save you. How fast are your reactions in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.poster.avif?t=1764682377\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.webm?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.mp4?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GUARANTEED FUN FOR EVERYONE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pros to casuals, choose how you want to play with customizable difficulty options. Adjust vision range in the dark and explore other accessibility-friendly settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/5ce7221a804ac4cbf8d6d9ca3328492f.poster.avif?t=1764682377\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/5ce7221a804ac4cbf8d6d9ca3328492f.webm?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/5ce7221a804ac4cbf8d6d9ca3328492f.mp4?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MOVE IN BIG, RISKY STEPS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have a limited number of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.poster.avif?t=1764682377\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.webm?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.mp4?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GATHER PRECIOUS CRYSTALS &amp; GEMS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crystal and gem comes with its own unique challenge. Only the most skilled adventurers can uncover every lost treasure hidden in the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.poster.avif?t=1764682377\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.webm?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.mp4?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BATTLE EPIC BOSS FIGHTS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Fog will do anything to keep the world in darkness. Only sharp reflexes, precise movement, and fearless determination will let you defeat his shadowy allies and ultimately face him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.poster.avif?t=1764682377\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.webm?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.mp4?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developer &amp; how this game came to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Ramy! Light Dude is my first ever video game on Steam! This whole game was born from suffering\u2026\u00a0I was walking back from the bathroom in the dark, confident I knew the layout of my own room... until my bed frame reminded me I didn\u2019t... My toe lost 99% of its HP, but at least I unlocked a new game idea!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055110?t=1764682377","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/04051bbb0075fc416fad653e109be6247c67ec41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764682377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/2a00e22c6cd993172f440a0459cceb9e03786851/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764682377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/2a00e22c6cd993172f440a0459cceb9e03786851/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764682377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EVERY STEP IS A RISK. CAN YOU MAKE IT?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think before you move. Once you move, your vision gets limited, and only memory and reflexes can save you. How fast are your reactions in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.poster.avif?t=1764682377\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.webm?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.mp4?t=1764682377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GUARANTEED FUN FOR EVERYONE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pros to casuals, choose how you want to play with customizable difficulty options. Adjust vision range in the dark and explore other accessibility-friendly settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_i